{"unit_id":"Simon314620__dsh-turn-index#card-zh","repo":"Simon314620/dsh-turn-index","commit":"a324ecde201a219448c23c1c8bbd872bdab512b4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-index 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的对话轮次索引插件，在聊天界面右侧提供可收起的侧边栏。它订阅当前会话快照，将用户提问按轮次列出，并把 steering 补充提问缩进显示。用户可以点击条目平滑跳转到聊天消息，阅读时索引会跟随当前轮次；历史窗口支持继续加载更早内容。窄屏可切换为圆点窄条，界面提供中英文文案。适合需要快速浏览或定位长对话的 DSH Web 用户；需要宿主提供 sessions、slots 和 locale 客户端服务，无需额外密钥配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:99-121","lib/client.js:343-359","lib/client.js:368-385","lib/client.js:508-525"]}
{"unit_id":"Simon314620__dsh-turn-index#card-en","repo":"Simon314620/dsh-turn-index","commit":"a324ecde201a219448c23c1c8bbd872bdab512b4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-turn-index adds a turn index sidebar to the DSH Web chat. It lists user questions, indents follow-ups, and lets users jump to a message. The list follows the current turn and can load earlier history. It includes Chinese and English labels and uses the host sessions, slots, and locale services.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:99-121","lib/client.js:343-359","lib/client.js:368-385","lib/client.js:508-525"]}
